.TH QUIPU-IMPORT-REVIEW-REOPEN 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import\-review\-reopen \- Reopen a rejected or expired staged share
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import review reopen\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-reason\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIshare\-id\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reopen a rejected or expired staged share
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Actor recorded in operation provenance
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Reason recorded for the operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIshare\-id\fR>

